msgstr "Developer mode shows a panel on the left to change weather, season and time, and to teleport;\npress F to fly (Space up, C down, Shift faster) and N while flying to pass through walls. Leaving developer mode lands you.\nDeveloper mode is not saved; every start is in normal mode."

